# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Anything prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ is exposed
# to the browser bundle — keep secrets out of those.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Database — Neon Postgres
# Get a free DB at https://neon.tech, copy the pooled "connection string".
# The serverless driver works fine with the unpooled URL too for migrations.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host.neon.tech/dbname?sslmode=require"

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Clerk — auth
# Keyless mode works in dev without these. For deploy, claim the keyless
# instance from the in-app banner and paste the keys here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Anthropic / Liaison
# Phase 1 deploys with LIAISON_MOCK=1 — the 3 "deep" specialists then throw
# and fall back to canned content (see lib/orchestrator.ts:325). Local dev
# uses operator's Claude subscription auth via the agent SDK, no key needed.
# Phase 2 will introduce ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LIAISON_MOCK=1
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
